<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>G4S Checkout - Coming soon</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      align-items: center;
      background: #FAF6F1;
      color: #1C1916;
      display: flex;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    main { max-width: 560px; }
    p:first-child {
      color: #B8765F;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 68px);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    p {
      color: #6B5F58;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    a {
      background: #1C1916;
      color: #FAF6F1;
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <p>Checkout</p>
    <h1>G4S account checkout is coming soon</h1>
    <p>
      This is the checkout entry point for creating a Glam4Style account. Payment and account creation are not connected yet.
    </p>
    <a href="{{ landing_url }}">Back to Glam4Style</a>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
